      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Segment Anything to Tracks",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## SAM3 → Tracks\n\nUse SAM3 (Segment Anything) when you want to track something specific, like\na particular object, by typing its name into the text encode prompt node.\n\n**What to set:**\n\n* Type what you're tracking in SAM3's text box (e.g. \"bee\")\n* Set `label` on SAM3 → Tracks to the same word (e.g. \"bee\")\n* Turn `store_mask_rle` OFF for smaller files if you don't need the exact pixels\n\n**Why SAM3?**\n\nSAM3 gives you the full pixel shape of the object, not just a box.\nThis means you get a precise outline (contour), centroid, and area. It handles any object you can name.\n\n**SAM3 is slow.** That is normal. You may run into a memory error. That means use a shorter video clip, ideally only a few seconds long."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
