      "outputs": [],
      "title": "About EasyTracksExport",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "The **EasyTracksExport** node provides different formats for saving the information found by SAM3 (centroid, bounding box, and contour). Files are saved to your Assets in the `ComfyUI/output/` directory:\n\n* **json** exports everything; use this if you are not sure. \n* **csv** exports one row per object per frame. This is good for p5.js, Excel, Processing.\n* **svg** exports vector shapes, good for Illustrator, plotting, and the web. \n* **jsx** runs inside AfterEffects to build a composition with one null layer per tracked object."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
