      "title": "SAM3 Video Outputs",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Here are two work-products created using SAM3:  \n\n* At left is SAM3's preview video, showing the detected object(s) masked with a semitransparent color.\n* At right, the `bee_sam_mask` video will be saved to your Assets in the `ComfyUI/output/` directory. \n\nBoth can also be saved by clicking on the `⋮` icon at lower right and selecting `Download`."
      ],
